<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates fall to 8.25 percent.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates fall to 8.25 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 8.25 percent on Saturday from 8.89 percent on Thursday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The central bank reported just a single transaction, worth three million dinars ($4.2 million) in Saturday's market.</p>
<p>$1 = 0.709 dinars</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
